`s 695(4)(c) the vote or demand is the same as a vote or demand by the member` MEANS
    IF `the vote or demand is made by a person as proxy for a member`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a vote and a demand for a poll by a person as proxy for a member"

