    CONSIDER `s 724(1) this section applies` `a limited company purchases shares in accordance with Chapter 4` `the purchase is made out of distributable profits`
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether section 724 applies is not known
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
         IF `the shares are cancelled forthwith under section 729`
