       AND `the date on which the company gave notice of cancellation to the registrar` AT MOST (`s 708(1) the last day for giving notice of cancellation to the registrar` `the date on which the shares are delivered to the company`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the company must give notice of cancellation to the registrar, within the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the shares are delivered to it"

@ref s 708(1) The company must give notice of cancellation within the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the shares are delivered to it (src:9302-9305)
